## What Was Fixed:

### 1. __FileOutput .url() Method Handling__ ✅

The critical bug was that the `.url()` method on FileOutput objects is __async__ and needs to be awaited:

```typescript
// BEFORE (broken):
imageUrl = typeof (output as any).url === 'function' ? (output as any).url() : (output as any).url;

// AFTER (working):
imageUrl = await (output as any).url();
```

__Additional improvements:__

- Handle nested FileOutput objects in arrays
- Better error handling when extracting URLs
- Try multiple extraction strategies (function call, property, array)

